<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo Corp says '96 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Corp says '96 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daewoo Corp, a unit of South Korea's Daewoo Group, said it saw its provisional 1996 net profit rise to 73 billion won from 60.3 billion won in 1995.  </p>
<p>The company said its sales were seen rising to 19.01 trillion won from 15.02 trillion a year earlier.</p>
<p>Daewoo Corp said it would hold its shareholder meeting on March 8, after which full results would be available.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
